Subject: [PATCH] speculative: size drafts from measured acceptance
 (--spec-draft-adaptive)

Regenerated from rocmmainmtp 0007 for unslothai b11160 + PRs 144/137 + 0008/0009:
the draft-simple init and DFlash block-size hunks re-anchored by hand.
